    <h1>Free no-show cost calculator</h1>
    <p>Estimate the service revenue behind unpaid, unfilled appointments. No account is needed.</p>
    <h2>How to calculate your estimate</h2>
    <p>Average appointment value × (missed appointments − refilled slots), minus retained payments and per-visit costs avoided, gives the monthly estimate. The result stops at zero. Multiply by 12 for a yearly estimate at the same rate.</p>
    <p>For example, 8 missed appointments at 60 each equals 480 per month, or 5,760 over twelve months, in your chosen currency.</p>
    <p>For a more detailed example, refill 2 of those 8 slots, keep 100 in payments for the 6 empty slots, and avoid 10 in costs per empty visit: the monthly earnings at risk are 200. Include only retained payments for the remaining empty slots and exclude fixed costs such as rent. The scenario assumes a proportional reduction in empty slots with the same average value, payments and avoidable costs. Actual outcomes vary. Currency selection does not convert amounts.</p>
    <noscript><p>Enable JavaScript for the interactive calculator, or use the formula above with your own figures.</p></noscript>
